msgstr "Lineaar"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:234
msgid "Runge-Kutta"
msgstr "Runge-Kutta"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:235
msgid "<p>Select the right interpolation method to set the image quality."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du de Estemeermetood utsöken, se leggt de Bildgööd fast."

