#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:76
msgid "Synchronize panels automatically"
msgstr "Paneels automaatsch synkroniseren"

#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:77
msgid ""
"<p>Set this option to automatically synchronize zooming and panning between "
"left and right panels if the images have the same size."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn de twee Biller de sülve Grött hebbt un Du "
"wullt, dat Ännern an de Ansichtgrött un Verschuuvakschonen op beed Biller "
"warkt."

#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:81
msgid "Selecting a thumbbar item loads image to the right panel"
msgstr "Utsöken vun en Bild op den Vöransichtbalken laadt dat na't rechte Paneel"

#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:83
msgid ""
"<p>Set this option to automatically load an image into the right panel when "
"the corresponding item is selected on the thumbbar."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat wullt, dat Utsöken vun en Bild op "
"den Vöransichtbalken laadt dat automaatsch na't rechte Paneel"

#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:86
msgid "Load full image size"
msgstr "Bild in Orginaalgrött laden"

#: utilities/setup/setuplighttable.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<p>Set this option to load full image size in preview panel instead a "
"reduced one. Because this option will take more time to load image, use it "
"only if you have a fast computer."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du dat Bild mit sien hele Grött in de Vöransicht hebben "
"wullt. Dat Laden vun't Bild duert denn wat länger, bruuk disse Optschoon man "
"bloots, wenn Du en gau Reekner hest."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:113
msgid "Common Metadata Actions"
msgstr "Allgemeen Metadaten-Akschonen"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:117
msgid "&Save image tags as \"Keywords\" tag"
msgstr "Slötelwöör binnen \"Ke&ywords\"-Feld sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:118
msgid "<p>Turn this option on to store the image tags in the XMP and IPTC tags."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du de Bild-Slötelwöör binnen de XMP- un IPTC-Feller "
"wohren wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:122
msgid "&Save default photographer identity as tags"
msgstr "&Standardweert för den Fotograaf sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:123
msgid ""
"<p>Turn this option on to store the default photographer identity into the "
"XMP and IPTC tags. You can set this value in the Identity setup page."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du den Standardweert för den Fotograaf na "
"de IPTC-Feller sekern wullt. Du kannst den Weert op de Siet \"Identiteet\" "
"binnen de Instellen fastleggen."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:128
msgid "&Save default credit and copyright identity as tags"
msgstr "&Standardweerten för Dank un Copyright sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:129
msgid ""
"<p>Turn this option on to store the default credit and copyright identity "
"into the XMP and IPTC tags. You can set this value in the Identity setup "
"page."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du de Standardweerten för Dank un Copyright na de XMP- "
"un IPTC-Feller sekern wullt. Du kannst disse Weerten op de Siet \"Identiteet"
"\" binnen de Instellen fastleggen."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:134
msgid "&Save image captions as embedded text"
msgstr "&Bildtiteln as inbett Text sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<p>Turn this option on to store image captions into the JFIF Comment "
"section, EXIF tag, XMP tag, and IPTC tag."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du den Bildtitel na den JFIF-Afsnitt, na't EXIF-, dat "
"XMP- un dat IPTC-Feld sekern wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:139
msgid "&Save image timestamp as tags"
msgstr "Bild-Tietmark binnen Feller &sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<p>Turn this option on to store the image date and time into the EXIF, XMP, "
"and IPTC tags."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du dat Datum un de Tiet vun't Bild binnen de EXIF-, "
"XMP- un IPTC-Feller wohren wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:144
msgid "&Save image rating as tags"
msgstr "Bildbeweerten as &Metadaten sekern"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:145
msgid "<p>Turn this option on to store the image rating into EXIF tag and XMP tags."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Beweerten na de EXIF- un XMP-Feller sekern "
"wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:167
msgid "Visit Exiv2 project website"
msgstr "Na Exiv2-Projektnettsiet gahn"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:172
msgid ""
"<p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exif'>EXIF</a></b> is a standard "
"used by most digital cameras today to store technical informations about "
"photograph.</p><p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPTC'>IPTC</a></"
"b> is an old standard used in digital photography to store photographer "
"informations in pictures.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exif'>EXIF</a></b> is en "
"Standard, den de mehrsten modeernen Kameras bruukt, wenn se technische "
"Informatschonen över dat Bild sekert.</p><p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/IPTC-NAA-Standard'>IPTC</a></b> is en anner Standard för de "
"Digitaalfotografie, mit den sik Informatschonen na Biller inbetten laat.</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:180
msgid ""
"<p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Metadata_Platform'>XMP</a></b> is a new standard used in digital "
"photography dedicaced to remplace IPTC.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Metadata_Platform'>XMP</a></b> is en nieg Standard in de "
"Digitaalfotografie. He schall maal IPTC utwesseln.</p>"

